    the service owed)
Constructed meaning c08_1 (passage 9, inferred): Because pupils are allowed to spend most of their time together in heavenly light, their lingering longing to dwell above is reconciled with compulsory turn-taking so that ruling is accepted as a stern necessity rather than refused.
    built from: Philosopher unwilling to descend (provides the lingering reluctance and longing
