Constructed meaning c08_2 (passage 9, inferred): Only future rulers who are given a better life of true philosophy and made truly rich in virtue and wisdom will look down on political ambition and therefore avoid the fighting over office that ruins rulers and state, making a well-ordered state possible.
    built from: Better Life For Rulers (states the requirement of a better life than ruling for
